Here is a summary of the resolutions:

### 1. Linter / Static Analysis Failures Resolved
- **Problem**: In [packages/core/test-setup.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/test_large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_24480/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/test-setup.ts#L18), assigning the shimmed class to `globalThis.File` with an `as any` cast triggered an ESLint error violation for `@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any`.
- **Resolution**: Implemented the recommended type-safe bypass from Option A in the feedback, casting the class `as unknown as typeof File`:
  ```typescript
  // Shim globalThis.File on older Node.js versions (like Node 18) for undici compatibility
  if (typeof globalThis.File === 'undefined') {
    globalThis.File = class File extends (globalThis.Blob || class {}) {
      name = '';
      lastModified = 0;
      webkitRelativePath = '';
    } as unknown as typeof File;
  }
  ```

### 2. Validation & Verification

